WEBVTT

00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:11.970
I'll never be easily loved...

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:19.177
Am I just too clumsy?

00:01:19.821 --> 00:01:26.386
That girl who looks good in pink...

00:01:27.028 --> 00:01:33.126
Is that who you want?

00:01:33.802 --> 00:01:37.761
Is red not good enough?

00:01:37.872 --> 00:01:44.778
The rabbit with red eyes runs away.

00:01:44.879 --> 00:01:52.149
Even though I loved you so much...

00:01:52.253 --> 00:02:00.253
If I'm sad, I'm going to die.

00:02:00.428 --> 00:02:06.925
The rabbit that you like...

00:02:07.602 --> 00:02:14.702
...isn't on the moon.
It's just a rabbit...

00:02:33.761 --> 00:02:35.354
I'm not...

00:02:37.966 --> 00:02:39.559
...a bug.

00:02:41.636 --> 00:02:42.660
Cry of the Worm

00:02:48.643 --> 00:02:52.511
| said I was quitting
the Itto-ryu, and now look at me.

00:02:52.614 --> 00:02:54.639
Did you tell Kage already?

00:02:54.749 --> 00:02:55.773
Yeah.

00:02:57.886 --> 00:02:58.910
Tai.

00:03:01.789 --> 00:03:04.451
What'll you do after
your wound heals?

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.150
Let's see...

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:12.057
If I'm going to fight samurai
without relying on the Itto-ryu...

00:03:12.167 --> 00:03:15.137
...I guess I'll murder them
in the streets of Banchou.

00:03:15.236 --> 00:03:20.572
Hey, why don't I plow into
a daimyo's group with just a wakizashi?

00:03:21.176 --> 00:03:23.941
That's amazing. So cool.

00:03:24.979 --> 00:03:26.504
You're kidding, right?

00:03:26.614 --> 00:03:27.843
I'm kidding.

00:03:28.283 --> 00:03:31.878
Oren, there's
a visitor for Sir Magatsu.

00:03:33.121 --> 00:03:35.089
Who would that be?

00:03:41.696 --> 00:03:42.561
Manji.

00:03:43.898 --> 00:03:46.731
I'm thinking of going
on a little trip today.

00:03:46.834 --> 00:03:48.632
Do whatever you want.

00:03:49.304 --> 00:03:50.362
What's wrong?

00:03:53.641 --> 00:03:54.369
Hey.

00:03:54.475 --> 00:03:55.465
No.

00:03:55.843 --> 00:03:57.902
| didn't say anything yet.

00:03:58.012 --> 00:04:00.208
| already knew what you'd say.

00:04:00.315 --> 00:04:01.749
Alcohol, right?

00:04:03.351 --> 00:04:04.750
There's lodging...

00:04:04.852 --> 00:04:09.813
...then meals, and also money
for maps and riding river ferries.

00:04:10.692 --> 00:04:12.990
It all really adds up.

00:04:13.228 --> 00:04:16.528
It won't kill you to cut
back on everything else.

00:04:16.731 --> 00:04:20.361
No, but then I might as well be dead.

00:04:20.768 --> 00:04:22.736
| said no, so no.

00:04:30.311 --> 00:04:32.177
The weather's sure nice.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.544
But it's a little hot.

00:04:34.649 --> 00:04:38.279
Days like this are
perfect for eating kuzukiri...

00:04:38.386 --> 00:04:41.412
...but instead I'm out here
on the street looking for...

00:04:41.522 --> 00:04:45.652
...my own hot and cold encounter
with an attractive young lady.

00:04:46.828 --> 00:04:50.765
But then hoping for that
is like tilting at windmills.

00:04:51.432 --> 00:04:54.060
| should have
chilled sake when I get there...

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:58.061
What was that for, asshole?

00:04:58.172 --> 00:05:01.608
You have the nerve to be spiteful
when you're caught whoring...

00:05:01.709 --> 00:05:03.643
...behind your husband's back?

00:05:03.745 --> 00:05:07.375
Don't make me laugh,
you underpaid dimwit.

00:05:08.149 --> 00:05:11.881
If we're comparing you two
as men, he's way better than you!

00:05:13.888 --> 00:05:19.884
While I'm at it, yours is like a little
rhubarb, and his is like a giant radish.

00:05:20.561 --> 00:05:24.657
What did you say?
Come on, say it one more time!

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.168
The heat just went away.

00:05:28.369 --> 00:05:33.239
She's not that young,
but she's good looking.

00:05:33.775 --> 00:05:36.142
And wow, talk about spirit.

00:05:38.713 --> 00:05:41.876
Who the hell are you,
anyway? She's my wife!

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:47.347
Only a miscreant would humiliate
a woman in the middle of the street.

00:05:51.492 --> 00:05:52.482
Honey!

00:05:52.994 --> 00:05:54.723
Hey, what's the big idea?

00:05:54.829 --> 00:05:57.628
Sorry about that.
He's your husband, huh?

00:05:58.032 --> 00:06:02.731
Your beauty moved me so.
| couldn't stop myself from acting.

00:06:03.638 --> 00:06:05.072
I'm impressed.

00:06:05.473 --> 00:06:08.738
A tough samurai
isn't exactly a rare sight...

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:12.245
...but it's a different
story when they're unarmed.

00:06:12.347 --> 00:06:14.714
That's quite an arm you've got, sir.

00:06:14.816 --> 00:06:17.911
All the better
to be held with, perhaps?

00:06:18.753 --> 00:06:20.778
You're referring to that argument?

00:06:20.888 --> 00:06:26.292
| don't mean to take the moral high
ground, but we've only just met...

00:06:26.794 --> 00:06:28.228
I thought so.

00:06:28.696 --> 00:06:31.688
| like women,
but I don't like coercion.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:36.367
| was half kidding too.
Let's just laugh and leave it at that.

00:06:36.904 --> 00:06:38.668
I'll be leaving now.

00:06:40.074 --> 00:06:41.542
Hold on!

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.613
Wow...

00:06:52.153 --> 00:06:54.019
How lovely.

00:06:55.823 --> 00:06:58.224
Well, it'll keep us cool at least.

00:06:58.326 --> 00:06:59.191
Yeah.

00:07:01.095 --> 00:07:03.189
| said I'd treat you...

00:07:04.332 --> 00:07:07.632
...but other than sake,
| don't have much to offer.

00:07:08.202 --> 00:07:10.330
Hey, this is plenty.

00:07:10.605 --> 00:07:13.700
My favorite dish is soybean
pulp dressed with mustard.

00:07:13.808 --> 00:07:15.936
| have some soybean pulp.

00:07:16.577 --> 00:07:17.703
And...

00:07:20.782 --> 00:07:22.113
It's rhubarb.

00:07:23.251 --> 00:07:24.980
It's his favorite.

00:07:26.587 --> 00:07:29.989
Say what you will,
but you still adore your husband.

00:07:30.792 --> 00:07:32.089
Yeah...

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:34.687
He's ordinary...

00:07:35.863 --> 00:07:37.729
...and no good at his job.

00:07:41.269 --> 00:07:42.737
What's the matter?

00:07:42.837 --> 00:07:47.138
Back in the day, a friend of mine
was poisoned at a dinner gathering.

00:07:47.575 --> 00:07:52.706
Since then I've become
really cowardly about meals.

00:07:53.815 --> 00:07:55.613
So I should taste it?

00:07:55.716 --> 00:07:57.707
I truly apologize.

00:08:06.561 --> 00:08:09.963
Feel better now?
It's not very strong though.

00:08:14.635 --> 00:08:16.603
This must be poison.

00:08:17.038 --> 00:08:18.472
It's too good.

00:08:37.959 --> 00:08:39.085
My fingers...

00:08:40.194 --> 00:08:41.161
Oh?

00:08:42.363 --> 00:08:44.491
Are you drunk already?

00:08:50.805 --> 00:08:53.900
If poison of that caliber
is enough to finish you...

00:08:54.008 --> 00:08:57.535
.| guess your stomach
isn't as tough as your fists.

00:08:58.246 --> 00:08:59.407
I knew it...

00:08:59.514 --> 00:09:01.846
Wait, why is it just me?

00:09:01.949 --> 00:09:06.147
You ate the same food I did
and drank the same sake.

00:09:08.756 --> 00:09:12.386
Itto-ryu deputy leader,
Fusano Kenei.

00:09:13.227 --> 00:09:16.356
A former low-ranking cop
who went broke and deserted.

00:09:16.464 --> 00:09:19.900
After that, you changed your
name and joined the Itto-ryu.

00:09:20.001 --> 00:09:22.595
Officious and fond of women.

00:09:23.204 --> 00:09:25.502
Well? Was that accurate?

00:09:26.574 --> 00:09:31.102
Who did you get that from?
Don't tell me there's a traitor!

00:09:32.313 --> 00:09:34.304
I'm asking the questions.

00:09:34.415 --> 00:09:37.350
It's none of your
business how I found out.

00:09:38.553 --> 00:09:42.046
In any case, you don't
have much longer to live.

00:09:43.224 --> 00:09:47.422
Also, thanks for eating
plenty of my cooking.

00:09:47.962 --> 00:09:51.296
| was more worried
about that than my acting.

00:09:51.732 --> 00:09:54.929
That poison isn't
so strong it'll kill you.

00:09:55.736 --> 00:10:00.640
But you're suffering, so I'll end
your misery as thanks for today.

00:10:01.008 --> 00:10:03.978
Right here so it won't hurt.

00:10:04.812 --> 00:10:08.112
| just made
the biggest mistake of my life.

00:10:08.783 --> 00:10:12.219
I've often said that all is vanity...

00:10:13.154 --> 00:10:18.217
But down on my luck or not, I'm still
the Itto-ryu's second-in-command.

00:10:18.326 --> 00:10:21.728
Even though I'm poisoned...

00:10:22.964 --> 00:10:28.733
...can't face my comrades
if I let a bitch get the best of me!

00:10:34.408 --> 00:10:37.036
B-But I blocked it with my sword!

00:10:37.144 --> 00:10:40.136
You should have dodged it instead.

00:10:47.755 --> 00:10:48.745
Idiot.

00:10:49.624 --> 00:10:52.594
Women can kill too,
when the time comes.

00:10:55.763 --> 00:10:56.889
I'm sorry.

00:10:57.431 --> 00:11:00.992
| borrowed the kimono,
geta, and the stove...

00:11:01.102 --> 00:11:04.663
...but I'll be sure to call
someone over, so ho hard feelings?

00:11:05.272 --> 00:11:07.741
Sorry for causing a ruckus...

00:11:12.713 --> 00:11:16.240
Itto-ryu swordsman,
Morozumi Chougo.

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:18.341
How do you know my name?

00:11:18.452 --> 00:11:20.113
| have a question.

00:11:20.221 --> 00:11:24.385
How many are there in the Iltto-ryu
who could be called instructors?

00:11:24.492 --> 00:11:25.789
Say what?

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:30.957
If you don't talk, I'll kill you.
If you do, I'll tell you what I'm after.

00:11:31.832 --> 00:11:34.665
It's up to you to believe me or not.

00:11:35.503 --> 00:11:38.871
T-The Itto-ryu has
no acting instructors.

00:11:39.473 --> 00:11:45.276
But there are about 30 I know of with
sword skills just below our leader's.

00:11:45.713 --> 00:11:48.774
30, huh? You're sure about that?

00:11:49.216 --> 00:11:52.880
That's all of them in Edo.
Hurry and take this off!

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:54.685
Is that so.

00:11:55.756 --> 00:11:56.723
Sorry.

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:05.791
Shinriji, you're looking nicer now.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:07.965
Oh, yeah?

00:12:08.069 --> 00:12:11.562
Hey, Hyaku,
what about where I hit you?

00:12:13.107 --> 00:12:14.597
It barely hurt...

00:12:23.117 --> 00:12:25.017
Hey, are you okay?

00:12:25.319 --> 00:12:30.587
Before I served him poison, I drank
about half a liter of sesame oil.

00:12:31.225 --> 00:12:33.250
It was quite an adventure.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:36.625
Amazing!
You're risking your life, as usual!

00:12:37.765 --> 00:12:40.097
What's with the "as usual"?

00:12:40.768 --> 00:12:45.365
But I bet even an idiot like you
learned something from today's job.

00:12:46.107 --> 00:12:47.097
Yes!

00:12:47.208 --> 00:12:52.169
| feel fulfilled just getting
to play the role of your husband!

00:12:53.314 --> 00:12:55.646
You can go home now.

00:12:56.283 --> 00:12:57.250
Why?

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:04.458
Morozumi Chougo

00:13:10.865 --> 00:13:14.426
They say: to boil beans,
use their own husks to make the fire.

00:13:15.936 --> 00:13:16.960
Infinity.

00:13:18.172 --> 00:13:18.968
Infinity.

00:13:20.074 --> 00:13:21.473
Hey, Manji.

00:13:24.678 --> 00:13:26.146
Let's stop here.

00:13:27.648 --> 00:13:30.015
How long has it been since lunch?

00:13:30.117 --> 00:13:32.085
Not very long, I guess.

00:13:34.989 --> 00:13:36.099
Edo Suzume, Revised Edition

00:13:36.123 --> 00:13:37.716
Edo Suzume, Revised Edition
Hey, Rin...

00:13:38.926 --> 00:13:42.191
You're the one
who said it won't kill us...

00:13:42.296 --> 00:13:47.200
...to cut down on costs other than
maps, lodging, meals, and ferry fees.

00:13:49.837 --> 00:13:51.703
You're right. Sorry.

00:13:59.246 --> 00:14:03.479
Warabimochi and barley tea.
Also, where's the restroom?

00:14:03.584 --> 00:14:05.609
You'll see it inside the back door.

00:14:05.719 --> 00:14:07.380
| figured as much.

00:14:07.488 --> 00:14:10.458
Number two or
number one? Or maybe...

00:14:13.194 --> 00:14:15.492
You expect me to answer that?

00:14:38.385 --> 00:14:41.286
You're blocking the light, you know.

00:14:42.189 --> 00:14:44.385
Either sit down or leave.

00:14:53.033 --> 00:14:56.628
You were looking
at something interesting.

00:14:58.072 --> 00:15:00.370
It's just a cut-out map.

00:15:00.474 --> 00:15:03.171
There were marks here and there.

00:15:03.277 --> 00:15:05.211
Every one was a dojo...

00:15:05.312 --> 00:15:10.773
...that was forced into submission by
a certain school these past few years.

00:15:11.151 --> 00:15:14.416
Huh, you know a lot about this.

00:15:15.556 --> 00:15:18.753
Monks should be
detached from worldly matters.

00:15:18.859 --> 00:15:23.524
That's not all. I also know
about the man you both seek.

00:15:27.201 --> 00:15:31.104
You've done all this traveling,
and you still don't know...

00:15:31.605 --> 00:15:35.769
...where to find that man,
Anotsu Kagehisa?

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:39.502
How do you know about that?

00:15:40.714 --> 00:15:41.943
Uji tea.

00:15:42.783 --> 00:15:46.981
Okay, that's Uji tea. Here's the
barley tea and warabimochi.

00:15:47.087 --> 00:15:48.248
Sure, yeah...

00:15:48.722 --> 00:15:50.588
Also, some sakuramochi.

00:15:50.691 --> 00:15:55.026
We're out of that,
but we do have kashiwamochi.

00:15:55.729 --> 00:15:57.026
That's fine.

00:15:57.131 --> 00:15:59.259
Thanks, sorry about that.

00:16:01.168 --> 00:16:04.399
So back to our conversation.

00:16:09.877 --> 00:16:13.711
You said just before,
"the man you both seek."

00:16:15.382 --> 00:16:17.316
How'd you know I wasn't alone?

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:31.296
I'm an Itto-ryu swordsman.

00:16:31.832 --> 00:16:35.826
Name's Shizuma Eiku.

00:16:38.505 --> 00:16:41.440
As you can see,
I'm not wearing a sword.

00:16:54.021 --> 00:16:56.956
| knew from the start
you weren't a monk.

00:16:57.725 --> 00:16:59.955
You smell too strongly of blood.

00:17:00.728 --> 00:17:03.390
I've killed 128 so far.

00:17:03.497 --> 00:17:07.957
This is only my assumption,
but you must be in a different league.

00:17:08.435 --> 00:17:12.338
So what's an Itto-ryu samurai
doing here without a sword?

00:17:14.575 --> 00:17:15.838
To kill Anotsu.

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:23.716
Did you hear about me
from that Magatsu guy?

00:17:24.551 --> 00:17:25.848
That's right.

00:17:25.953 --> 00:17:29.856
He was praising
your swordsmanship...

00:17:30.858 --> 00:17:32.792
...and also your immortal body.

00:17:39.566 --> 00:17:42.900
Anotsu Kagehisa,
leader of the Ittoryu...

00:17:43.604 --> 00:17:46.198
He's definitely considered a genius...

00:17:46.306 --> 00:17:51.870
...but as long as he is human,
he cannot avoid the fate of death.

00:17:53.013 --> 00:17:56.813
He might not even live
to see his ambition fulfilled.

00:17:59.386 --> 00:18:06.019
Don't you think a true leader is one
with both the technique and flesh...

00:18:06.627 --> 00:18:10.427
...to know he's certain
to fulfill his dream?

00:18:11.331 --> 00:18:15.359
So your plan is to pair up with me
and take over the Itto-ryu, huh?

00:18:15.469 --> 00:18:20.134
If either of us are alone,
we won't be able to beat Anotsu.

00:18:20.641 --> 00:18:22.609
But if we're together...

00:18:25.746 --> 00:18:28.215
I'll let you live today. Get lost.

00:18:31.085 --> 00:18:32.575
That's your answer?

00:18:51.772 --> 00:18:54.173
Manji, are you okay?

00:18:54.575 --> 00:18:57.203
You're usually
supposed to hold trays.

00:19:01.849 --> 00:19:03.840
What's with this guy?

00:19:03.951 --> 00:19:08.718
He knew my body's immortal, but he
came at me with just a dagger...

00:19:09.756 --> 00:19:11.224
This man...

00:19:14.228 --> 00:19:15.787
I know him.

00:19:21.902 --> 00:19:25.964
You got your revenge again.
That's one less thing on your hands.

00:19:27.241 --> 00:19:28.504
L-Look...

00:19:38.352 --> 00:19:40.787
| thought you'd be...

00:19:40.888 --> 00:19:43.118
...more understanding.

00:19:45.058 --> 00:19:46.355
Is it the Kessenchu?

00:19:47.928 --> 00:19:49.896
Was it the old woman?

00:19:51.732 --> 00:19:54.702
I'm asking if this
was Yaobikuni's doing!

00:19:59.773 --> 00:20:04.233
| don't know her name.
She was an old Buddhist nun.

00:20:04.344 --> 00:20:06.005
Does that mean...

00:20:06.914 --> 00:20:10.111
...that old lady is helping the Itto-ryu?

00:20:10.918 --> 00:20:12.943
No, that's not true.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:16.583
She put the Kessenchu inside me...

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:20.183
...long before I had
any connection with the Itto-ryu.

00:20:20.794 --> 00:20:23.525
It was about two hundred years ago.

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:25.496
Two hundred years?

00:20:25.899 --> 00:20:29.028
I've watched the era
change with my own eyes.

00:20:30.003 --> 00:20:35.498
I've had five women as wives
and had more friends than that...

00:20:36.977 --> 00:20:39.344
...but they all died before me.

00:20:41.248 --> 00:20:43.216
Death is ruthless.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:47.978
But not being able to die is cruel too.

00:20:51.992 --> 00:20:55.622
However,
it doesn't mean there isn't a way.

00:21:07.074 --> 00:21:10.044
Nothing in this world is immortal.

00:21:10.744 --> 00:21:12.508
That includes us.

00:21:13.714 --> 00:21:17.275
You will learn this tonight.

00:21:18.151 --> 00:21:20.119
What are you talking about?

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:28.790
Manji, your wound...

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:30.927
That's weird.

00:21:31.198 --> 00:21:33.292
The worms aren't coming out.

00:21:52.853 --> 00:21:54.048
Manji!

00:21:58.959 --> 00:22:01.360
Go somewhere else!

00:22:03.063 --> 00:22:04.030
Why?

00:22:04.631 --> 00:22:06.599
Why did this happen?

00:22:07.701 --> 00:22:09.032
It's poison!

00:22:09.136 --> 00:22:10.262
Poison?

00:22:11.238 --> 00:22:14.367
Most likely on his dagger...

00:22:15.642 --> 00:22:17.303
Nice job...

00:22:18.145 --> 00:22:21.604
You got me, Shizuma Eiku.

00:22:34.194 --> 00:22:35.855
This may be it...

00:22:37.297 --> 00:22:38.264
Rin...

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:46.863
Even if I die, don't you set out
alone. Hurry and find another...

00:22:47.641 --> 00:22:50.736
Stop! I don't want
to hear those things!

00:22:52.679 --> 00:22:53.976
Manji!

00:22:55.282 --> 00:22:57.614
Manji! Maniji!

00:22:57.718 --> 00:22:59.049
Hang on!

00:22:59.486 --> 00:23:01.079
You can't die!

00:23:02.923 --> 00:23:04.357
Don't die!

00:23:15.469 --> 00:23:21.374
Sadly, I awakened...

00:23:21.475 --> 00:23:29.314
Overflowing reality is just...

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:35.313
...more of the empty lies.

00:23:39.359 --> 00:23:47.359
To be honest, I have
to get ready for the next one.

00:23:49.035 --> 00:23:55.099
The morning slides
in from the window.

00:23:55.409 --> 00:24:02.679
Regardless of what
I see, I remember.

00:24:02.783 --> 00:24:06.048
| remember...

00:24:06.153 --> 00:24:12.525
The unchanging wind always...

00:24:12.626 --> 00:24:18.929
...just said this as it passed by...

00:24:19.065 --> 00:24:27.065
"What's needed for
this endless journey?”

00:24:39.853 --> 00:24:42.686
Where should I go?

00:24:45.025 --> 00:24:46.459
Infinite Preview

00:24:57.971 --> 00:24:59.405
Styx
